   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 7b. Optionally copy the renamed files\n",
    "\n",
    "\ud83d\udca1 **Why it's gated:** copying thousands of files is hard to undo and uses disk. The default `RENAME_MODE = \"map_only\"` just writes the lookup CSV (Part 9). Review it, then change the setting in Part 1 and re-run only this cell. Originals are always **copied, never moved**."
   ]
